<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>사양 on InterP Blog</title><link>https://interp.blog/tags/%EC%82%AC%EC%96%91/</link><description>Recent content in 사양 on InterP Blog</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>ko-kr</language><lastBuildDate>Mon, 30 Oct 2017 08:31:03 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://interp.blog/tags/%EC%82%AC%EC%96%91/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Linux 에서 CPU/Memory/Disk 확인</title><link>https://interp.blog/linux-%EC%97%90%EC%84%9C-cpumemorydisk-%ED%99%95%EC%9D%B8/</link><pubDate>Mon, 30 Oct 2017 08:31:03 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://interp.blog/linux-%EC%97%90%EC%84%9C-cpumemorydisk-%ED%99%95%EC%9D%B8/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;자주 쓰긴 하지만, 곧바로 생각나지 않을 것을 대비해서&amp;hellip; 서버실 서버 사양을 전부 체크하려다 보니 어쩔 수 없이 정리했다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="cpu--memory-확인"&gt;CPU / Memory 확인
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;CPU / Memory 는 사실 쉽다. &lt;code&gt;/proc/cpuinfo&lt;/code&gt; 와 &lt;code&gt;/proc/meminfo&lt;/code&gt; 안에 들어있기 때문이다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;$ cat /proc/cpuinfo &lt;span class="p"&gt;|&lt;/span&gt; grep &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;model name&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;  &lt;span class="p"&gt;|&lt;/span&gt; sort -u
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;model name : Intel&lt;span class="o"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;R&lt;span class="o"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; Core&lt;span class="o"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;TM&lt;span class="o"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; i3-4160 CPU @ 3.60GHz
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;$ cat /proc/meminfo &lt;span class="p"&gt;|&lt;/span&gt; grep &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;MemTotal&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;MemTotal: &lt;span class="m"&gt;8040588&lt;/span&gt; kB
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="disk-확인"&gt;Disk 확인
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;df&lt;/code&gt; 는 mount 된 것만 확인이 가능해서 별로고, &lt;code&gt;lsblk&lt;/code&gt; 를 하면 마운트되지 않은 것까지 나온다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;$ lsblk
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;NAME MAJ:MIN RM SIZE RO TYPE MOUNTPOINT
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;sda 8:0 &lt;span class="m"&gt;0&lt;/span&gt; 477G &lt;span class="m"&gt;0&lt;/span&gt; disk
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;├─sda1 8:1 &lt;span class="m"&gt;0&lt;/span&gt; 468.8G &lt;span class="m"&gt;0&lt;/span&gt; part /
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;└─sda2 8:2 &lt;span class="m"&gt;0&lt;/span&gt; 8.2G &lt;span class="m"&gt;0&lt;/span&gt; part &lt;span class="o"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;SWAP&lt;span class="o"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;sdb 8:16 &lt;span class="m"&gt;0&lt;/span&gt; 2.7T &lt;span class="m"&gt;0&lt;/span&gt; disk
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;## df 는 sdb가 보이지 않는다.&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;$ df -h 
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;Filesystem Size Used Avail Use% Mounted on
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;/dev/sda1 462G 8.4G 430G 2% /
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;tmpfs 79G 224K 79G 1% /dev/shm
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>